Free the tune when ReadTag() finds no title.

The empty-title early return leaked the loaded tune on every tag read.

Upstream: generic bug, suitable for xbmc/audiodecoder.hvl.

--- a/src/HVLCodec.cpp
+++ b/src/HVLCodec.cpp
@@ -154,7 +154,10 @@
 
   std::string title = tune->ht_Name;
   if (title.empty())
+  {
+    hvl_FreeTune(tune);
     return false;
+  }
 
   tag.SetTitle(title);
   if (tune->ht_SubsongNr + 1 > 1)
